{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2021-09-03 16:15:00', 'title': 'CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC. COMPLETES PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED SALE OF CAESARS SOUTHERN INDIANA OPERATIONS TO THE EASTERN BAND OF CHEROKEE INDIANS', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS AND RENO, NEV., SEPT. 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC. (NASDAQ: CZR) ("CAESARS") TODAY ANNOUNCED THE CLOSING OF THE SALE OF THE OPERATIONS OF CAESARS SOUTHERN INDIANA TO THE EASTERN BAND OF CHEROKEE INDIANS ("EBCI") FOR APPROXIMATELY $250 MILLION.'}